			}
			id: "89BA3505D9F9AFF3"
			subtitle: "Tip"
			title: "&eFirst visit to a new End&r"
			description: ["The first time you enter a freshly generated BetterEnd End the server can freeze for 20 to 60 seconds while chunks generate. It recovers on its own.", "Click to mark this tip as read."]
